      "title": "Faculty Promotion & Tenure",
      "description": "Faculty Promotion & Tenure - Academic Personnel & Faculty Skip to content All the UW Current site Search scope All the UW Current site Enter search text University of Washington University of Washington UW HR Workday Employee Help UW Finance Faculty Senate Menu Home About us About Us Our Strategic Plan Leadership Team Office and Team Contacts Faculty Affairs Advisory Committee News News eDigest Archive For Academic Personnel For Academic Personnel & Faculty New Faculty @UW Faculty Development Faculty Inclusive Excellence ADVANCE Center for Institutional Change Faculty Review Resources Faculty Promotion & Tenure Librarian Reappointment & Promotion Academic Responsibilities Voting Guidelines Time Off and Leaves Postdoctoral Scholars Affairs & Operations Academic Personnel & Faculty Affairs Academic Titles and Ranks Resources Forms and Templates Policies and Procedures Appointment Actions Visas Academic Jobs Academic Personnel & Faculty Academic Personnel & Faculty Academic Personnel & Faculty Affairs For Academic Personnel & Faculty Faculty Promotion & Tenure Faculty Promotion & Tenure Welcome to the University of Washington’s Promotion and Tenure resource page! Our office is dedicated to supporting your academic journey by providing essential resources, services, and guidance. At the Office for Academic Personnel & Faculty, we empower faculty and staff through collaboration and excellence, fostering a thriving academic community. Together, we champion your passions and shared goals to inspire boundless success. Dr. Fred Nafukho Vice Provost, Office for Academic Personnel & Faculty Preparing Your Case Find Your Unit’s P&T Guidelines Crafting your CV & Self-assessment Case Contents Case Workflow & Outcomes Supporting Your Success Clock Waivers The Path to Promotion Using Interfolio RPT Logging in to RPT Candidate View Getting Help Policies & Terms Faculty Code Glossary Home For Academic Personnel & Faculty Faculty Review Resources Collegial Course